              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नए कपड़े पहनकर मीरा की बहन इतरा रही थी। nae kapṛe pahankar Mīrā kī bahan itrā rahī thī. Wearing her new clothes, Mira's sister was putting on airs."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (she …): वह इतराई, vah itrāī."
            }
          ]
        },
